WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.190
Star Wars is one of the most popular and influential
stories ever told. It began with the wildly

00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:10.589
successful Original Trilogy in the seventies
and eighties, and later there was the Prequel

00:00:10.589 --> 00:00:15.719
Trilogy – which most people agree was not
good. There are also heaps of books, comics,

00:00:15.719 --> 00:00:21.310
video games and TV shows which form an Expanded
Universe of stories set in the same continuity,

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:24.779
although they’re no longer considered canon
now that Disney has bought Star Wars from

00:00:24.779 --> 00:00:30.210
George Lucas. Disney is now making a new
trilogy, set thirty years after the original

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.830
one, so now’s a good time to have a look
at what happened in the original three Star

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:37.330
Wars movies, and what that might mean for
the new one.

00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:42.620
In A New Hope, an evil Empire rules the galaxy,
and is at war with a Rebel Alliance. The

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:46.920
Empire has massive spaceships, and armies
of Stormtroopers, and of course the iconic

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:52.580
Darth Vader. It also has the Death Star, a
huge armoured space station capable of destroying

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:57.230
whole planets. Rebel spies have stolen the
Empire’s plans to the Death Star, and hope

00:00:57.230 --> 00:01:01.690
to use them to find a weakness to destroy
the weapon. At the start of the movie, rebel

00:01:01.690 --> 00:01:06.390
leader Princess Leia is taking these plans
to rebels on Alderaan, but her ship is captured

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:11.990
by the Empire , so she hides the plans and
a message in a robot, or droid, called R2-D2,

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:16.740
who along with C3P0, escapes to the desert
planet Tatooine. That’s where we meet our

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:22.020
hero, Luke Skywalker, a farmboy living with
his uncle and aunt and dreaming of adventure.

00:01:22.020 --> 00:01:26.659
Luke finds Leia’s message in R2 , and
takes the droids to Obi-Wan Kenobi, one of

00:01:26.659 --> 00:01:31.920
the last remnants of an order of lightsaber-wielding
space-wizards called Jedi, who use a “mystical

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:36.650
energy field” called the Force to exert
magical power. He says that Luke’s father

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:41.760
was a Jedi who was betrayed and killed by
Darth Vader – a Jedi who turned to the Dark

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:46.110
Side of the Force. When Luke finds his aunt
and uncle killed by the Empire, he agrees

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:50.950
to go with Obi-Wan to deliver Leia’s plans
to the rebels. So they buy a ride on the Millenium

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:55.979
Falcon, a spaceship owned by the cynical,
self-serving smuggler Han Solo, and his hairy

00:01:55.979 --> 00:02:00.550
sidekick Chewbacca , who talks like this.
So they head to Leia’s home planet Alderaan

00:02:00.550 --> 00:02:04.940
– on the way Obi-Wan starts to train Luke
in the way of the Force – but when they

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:09.829
arrive, Alderaan’s gone, ‘cause the Empire
blew it up with the Death Star, because they’re

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:13.959
bad guys. The Falcon gets beamed into the
Death Star, so Luke and Han and Chewie go

00:02:13.959 --> 00:02:18.469
rescue Leia. There’re disguises, and a
trash compactor, and other shenanigans, and

00:02:18.469 --> 00:02:23.659
as they escape, Obi-Wan is killed by Darth
Vader. And as they leave the Falcon is tracked

00:02:23.659 --> 00:02:27.739
by the Empire to the Rebel base on Yavin IV, so the Death Star comes, and there’s a

00:02:27.739 --> 00:02:32.310
big space battle, and Luke uses the Force, and blows up the Death Star. It’s a big

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:36.279
victory for the Rebels, and selfish Han Solo
has a change of heart in time to come help,

00:02:36.279 --> 00:02:38.450
and get a medal with Luke.

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:43.219
In The Empire Strikes Back, the rebels have
established a new base on the ice world Hoth.

00:02:43.219 --> 00:02:47.090
Luke rides around on a funny ice llama called
a tauntaun, and is attacked by a Yeti called

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:52.029
a wampa. He almost dies in the cold , but
is saved by Han. This is part of Han’s

00:02:52.029 --> 00:02:55.779
transformation from someone who only cares
for himself to someone willing to risk his

00:02:55.779 --> 00:03:01.450
life for his friends. An Imperial probe discovers
the rebel base so the Empire comes in force,

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:06.779
with a big stompy robots called AT-ATs , and
Stormtroopers led by Darth Vader. So Han

00:03:06.779 --> 00:03:11.120
and Leia flee Hoth in the Millenium Falcon, with Chewie and 3P0, while Luke heads to

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:16.019
the swampy planet Dagobah because he was told
to by a force ghost of Obi-Wan, which is

00:03:16.019 --> 00:03:20.230
apparently a thing. Han and Leia escape from
Imperials, make out – ’cause there’s

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:24.480
nothing like some welding to get you in the
mood, and escape from a Freudian space slug

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:28.889
thing. On Dagobah, Luke meets a little green
Jedi Master called Yoda , who trains Luke

00:03:28.889 --> 00:03:33.449
in the way of the Force. Yoda tells us about
the dangers of the Dark Side of the Force,

00:03:33.449 --> 00:03:38.449
which is connected to negative emotions like
anger and fear and hate. Han and Leia travel

00:03:38.449 --> 00:03:42.569
to Cloud City, to meet Han’s old friend
Lando Calrissian, who ends up betraying them

00:03:42.569 --> 00:03:46.829
to the Empire. Luke comes to rescue his friends, but when he gets there, Han has already

00:03:46.829 --> 00:03:52.139
been carbon frozen into a living but inanimate
block, and taken by Boba Fett who plans to

00:03:52.139 --> 00:03:57.120
sell him to the crime lord Jabba the Hutt. Lando has a change of heart, and helps Leia

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:01.699
and co. escape from the Empire . Meanwhile,
Luke dramatically confronts Darth Vader, who

00:04:01.699 --> 00:04:07.529
cuts off Luke’s hand and says “I am your
father”. Luke refuses to join the bad guys,

00:04:07.529 --> 00:04:11.919
and escapes to be rescued by Leia, Lando,
Chewie and the droids.

00:04:11.919 --> 00:04:16.239
In Return of the Jedi, Leia, Lando, Chewie,
R2 and 3P0 infiltrate the Palace of Jabba

00:04:16.239 --> 00:04:20.870
the Hutt, who happens to be a gigantic slug. They revive Han from the carbonite, but

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:26.460
get caught by Jabba, and Leia is enslaved
in an uncomfortable bikini. Luke turns up,

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:31.479
now a powerful and confident Jedi Knight. He
bargains for Han’s life, kills a monster

00:04:31.479 --> 00:04:36.550
called a rancor, but ends up getting caught
as well. Jabba decides to feed Luke and Han

00:04:36.550 --> 00:04:41.419
to a big tentacled sand-mouth called a sarlacc, but the heroes escape – Luke kicks some

00:04:41.419 --> 00:04:46.639
ass, Han kills Boba accidentally, and Leia
kills Jabba with the very chains that bound

00:04:46.639 --> 00:04:51.770
her. Han and Leia meet back up with the Rebels,
and Luke returns to Dagobah, where Yoda dies.

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:56.860
The ghost of Obi-Wan tells Luke that Leia
is his twin sister, which makes this kiss

00:04:56.860 --> 00:05:01.289
kind of awkward. Meanwhile the Empire is
building a second Death Star, cause the first

00:05:01.289 --> 00:05:05.210
one worked so well, and the Rebels attack,
with Lando leading a space battle, while

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:09.360
on the forest moon of Endor, Han leads some
Rebels and also some surprisingly effective

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:13.770
teddy bears called Ewoks. There’s a speeder
bike chase, and some teddy bear antics, but

00:05:13.770 --> 00:05:18.870
in the end Luke confronts Vader, and meets
his master, the Emperor. They try to get

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:23.389
Luke to join the Dark Side. Luke struggles
with his emotions, and cuts off Vader’s

00:05:23.389 --> 00:05:27.550
hand, but ultimately rejects the Dark Side, so the Emperor tortures him with lightning,

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:33.259
and in a final act of sacrificial redemption,
Vader saves his son by killing the Emperor,

00:05:33.259 --> 00:05:38.129
and he has his helmet removed to look upon
his son before dying in Luke’s arms. The

00:05:38.129 --> 00:05:42.949
rebels destroy the second Death Star, Han
and Leia get together, and everybody celebrates

00:05:42.949 --> 00:05:49.229
– the Rebellion has beaten the Empire.
So Star Wars has themes of destiny, power,

00:05:49.229 --> 00:05:53.270
love, and redemption, but at the end of
the day what it’s really about is a simple

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:58.389
conflict between good and evil, with spaceships
and lightsabers and robots and aliens with

00:05:58.389 --> 00:06:02.129
funny names. It’s not particularly deep
stuff or anything, but it doesn’t need to

00:06:02.129 --> 00:06:06.360
be, it’s fun. And we can probably expect
something very similar in the upcoming Force

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:10.319
Awakens – indeed it still seems to be a
conflict between the remnants of the Empire

00:06:10.319 --> 00:06:14.099
and the rebellion. But that’s not to say
it won’t have its surprises. For example,

00:06:14.099 --> 00:06:18.479
based on Luke’s arc in the original trilogy,
and his absence from the Force Awakens trailers,

00:06:18.479 --> 00:06:22.800
it’s speculated that Luke might have turned
to the Dark Side, that he’s a bad guy in

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:27.280
this new movie. There are also lots of cool
theories about the original and prequel series

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:31.479
– so comment below if you’d like to see
more Star Wars videos explaining these ideas.

00:06:31.479 --> 00:06:35.150
Either way, hope you enjoyed this video. Many thanks to

00:06:35.150 --> 00:06:39.599
